  (text "NRST asserts from supervisor, case-open buffer or MCU reset.\nU15 drives LCD_RESET_N low without waiting for firmware startup.\nPC3 can also pull low on lock, expiry, cancel or display fault.\nPC3 open-drain; SCL/SDA open-drain on3.0V pull-ups.\nNo host raw-display command. Hardware reset is not a substitute for\nfingerprint gating of display content and authenticated transactions.\nValidate reset minimum width and complete physical LCD clearing."
    (at 225 220 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.3 1.3)
      )
    )
    (uuid "4acb8755-1b13-5298-bbe9-687b89711e38")
  )
)
